  "description": "OEDRO Dual Convex Platform drop running boards are precision-engineered for a perfect fit on the 2015-2026 Chevy Colorado Crew Cab / GMC Canyon Crew Cab. Featuring a durable three-tube design, they provide enhanced protection for the vehicle’s bottom and sides while preventing damage from obstacles. Built from high-strength Carbon steel with a corrosion-resistant powder-coated finish, these running boards ensure long-lasting performance in any conditions. The bolt-on installation requires no cutting or drilling, making setup quick and hassle-free.\nFeatures\nEnhanced Step Convenience: The 6-inch side pedals feature a two-level layout, making it easier to enter and exit lifted trucks and vehicles with oversized tires.\nMaximum Protection: The robust three-tube design shields the vehicle’s bottom and sides while preventing it from getting stuck on rocks or obstacles.\nEasy & Secure Installation: Welded brackets provide extra strength, ensuring a bolt-fixed installation with no cutting or drilling required.\nHeavy-Duty & Weather-Resistant: Made from high-strength Carbon steel with a durable powder-coated finish, this step is resistant to rust and corrosion, performing well in all conditions.\nSuperior Grip & Safety： Precision laser-cut tread surfaces enhance traction, delivering a non-slip, secure footing for safer access in any weather.\n1-year warranty: For your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2015-2026 Chevy Colorado Crew Cab.\nCompatible with 2015-2026 GMC Canyon Crew Cab.",
